          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ገንዘብ ፡ የምትድኑበትን ፡ እሱ ፡ ይነግ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ርሃል ፡ አለው ፡ ም ፡ ፱ ፥ ፵፫ ። ም ፡ ፪ ፥ ፴፯ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": "፯",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፯ ፤ ⟪ወኀሊፎ ፡ መልአክ ፡ ዘተናገሮ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "የነገረውም ፡ መልአክ ፡ አልፎ ፡ ከሄደ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 5,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በኋላ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 6,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ጸውዐ ፡ ክልኤተ ፡ እምወዓልያኒሁ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከባለሟሎቹ ፡ ሁለቱን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 8,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወአሐደ ፡ ኄረ ፡ እምፀማዱ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከጃን ፡ ገብሩ ፡ አንዱን ፡ ጠርቶ ። አንድ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ም ፡ በአፍአ ፡ ካሉ ፡ ብላቴኖቹ ፡ ሁለቱን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከባለሟሎቹ ፡ አንዱን ፡ ጠርቶ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": "፰",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፰ ፤ ⟪ወነገሮሙ ፡ ኵሎ ፡ ወለአኮሙ ፡ ሀገረ ፡ ኢዮጴ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "የነገረውን ፡ ነገር ፡ ሁሉ ፡ ነግሮ ፡ ወደ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ኢዮጴ ፡ ላካቸው ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "section_title",
          "text": "ክፍል ፡ ፲፰ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 16,
          "margin_tag": "፱",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፱ ፤ ⟪ወበሳኒታ ፡ እንዘ ፡ የሐውሩ ፡ በጽሑ ፡ ኢዮጴ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 17,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ኀበ ፡ አንቀጸ ፡ ሀገር ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 18,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በሁለተኛው ፡ ቀን ፡ ሲሄዱ ፡ ኢዮጴ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 19,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከከተማው ፡ በር ፡ ደረሱ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 20,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወጴጥሮስኒ ፡ ዐርገ ፡ ናሕሰ ፡ ጸሊ ፡ ጊዜ ፡ ቀትር ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 21,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጴጥሮስም ፡ በቀትር ፡ ጊዜ ፡ ከሰገነት ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 22,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ወጥቶ ፡ ይጸልይ ፡ ነበር ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 23,
          "margin_tag": "፲",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፲ ፤ ⟪እስመ ፡ ርኅበ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 24,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ተርቦ ፡ ነበርና ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 25,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወፈቀደ ፡ ይምሳሕ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 26,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሊመገብ ፡ ወዶ ፡ ሳለ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 27,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወእንዘ ፡ ያስተዳልዉ ፡ እሙንቱ ፡ መጽአ ፡ ድንጋፄ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 28,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ላዕሌሁ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 29,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ምግቡን ፡ እስቲአዘጋጁለት ፡ ድረስ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 30,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ተደሞ ፡ መጣበት ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 31,
          "margin_tag": "፲፩",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፲፩ ፤ ⟪ወርእየ ፡ ሰማየ ፡ ርኅወ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 32,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሰማይ፡ የተከፈተ፡ ሆኖ፡ አየ፡ ሐተታ፡ አሁ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        }
      ]
    },
